From: fryezero <108418382+fryezero@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:35:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] mu: host view of a window-sized player and GFx-style hit
 test

Player::set_gfx_view keeps a NoScale stage of the host window's size while
the viewport (render target) shows only the window's area, so each GFx
window can be rendered into a texture of its own size.  Player::gfx_hit_test
reports whether a visible shape (not under hitTestDisable) covers a
viewport point, as GFx Movie::HitTest does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 core/src/display_object/stage.rs | 25 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 core/src/player.rs               | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/src/display_object/stage.rs b/core/src/display_object/stage.rs
index 86f3d553..901875f9 100644
--- a/core/src/display_object/stage.rs
